            between the type of propositions and the type of booleans.
          %h2#impredicative_polymorphism Impredicative polymorphism
          %p
            Given a universe of all propositions
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
